+-------------------------------------------+
| TeaMail v1.02  -  EMail SubSystem For TA  |
+-------------------------------------------+
| A comprehensive stand alone E-Mail system |
| for TransAmiga BBS systems. Features:     |
|                                           |
| * Multiple e-mail address allocation      |
| * E-Mail address filtering                |
| * UU-Encoding on-the-fly                  |
| * Online reading of e-mail or downloading |
|                                           |
| [] Requires AmiTCP and Internet Account   |
|                                         +-|
+-----------------------------------------+-+
